       01 WS-SAVE-OK         GLOBAL PIC X.
       01 WS-QUESTION        GLOBAL PIC X(300).
       01 WS-ANSWER          GLOBAL PIC X(4).
      *>   The interface texts (spec 071 R44): one row per text, one column
