       01 WS-LANG-IX         GLOBAL PIC 9 VALUE 1.
       01 WS-TX-I            GLOBAL PIC 9(4).
       01 PC-TEXT-DATA       GLOBAL.
      *>   OPEN-TOPIC-FIRST
